# API keys are NOT configured via environment variables anymore.
#
# Building with any VITE_* variable set will abort the build on purpose, because
# Vite inlines those values into the public extension bundle. That is exactly how
# keys leaked in v1.0.0 / v1.1.0.
#
# To use an AI provider:
#   1. run `npm run build`
#   2. load dist/ in Chrome
#   3. open the extension's options page ("引擎设置") and paste your key there.
#
# Keys entered on the options page live only in chrome.storage.local on your machine.
